  "raw": "\nA TRICKY brainteaser challenges puzzlers to find the dragon egg hidden in the cushions.\nClarinetPark challenged social media users to find the egg Aftab Rashid created.\n2 The dragon egg trick was created by web developer Ashton Lin Credit: ClarinetPark\nHe posted the challenge after social media users rushed to draw his \"beautiful\" design, reported Newsflare.\nThe facial features on his sketch are of a young man, with uneven freckles covering his face and a crown atop his head.\nHis body and wings provide outline, while the cushions show details of his head.\nThe word \"dragon\" is writed into the back of the bookcase, where a few 'flaming' cushions are positioned.\nThere are nine drawings of chairs, a kitchen, a sofa, a pillow, a jersey, an egg white pouring from another cream-colored bag and a life raft from the ocean of cushions",
  "serialized": "A TRICKY brainteaser challenges puzzlers to find the dragon egg hidden in the cushions. ClarinetPark challenged social media users to find the egg Aftab Rashid created. 2 The dragon egg trick was created by web developer Ashton Lin Credit: ClarinetPark He posted the challenge after social media users rushed to draw his \"beautiful\" design, reported Newsflare. The facial features on his sketch are of a young man, with uneven freckles covering his face and a crown atop his head. His body and wings provide outline, while the cushions show details of his head. The word \"dragon\" is writed into the back of the bookcase, where a few 'flaming' cushions are positioned. There are nine drawings of chairs, a kitchen, a sofa, a pillow, a jersey, an egg white pouring from another cream-colored bag and a life raft from the ocean of cushions",
